        <p></p>
        <p>Susina Configuration Builder is a library to load and build configuration objects or arrays.
It's based on <a href="https://symfony.com/doc/current/components/config.html">Symfony Config</a> and it's inspired on
<a href="https://github.com/propelorm/Propel2/tree/master/src/Propel/Common/Config">Propel configuration sub-system</a>.</p>

        <h3>Where to start?</h3>

        <ul>
            <li><a href="guide/usage.html">Getting started</a>: to learn how to install and use the library.</li>
            <li><a href="guide/contributing.html">Contributing</a>: to learn how to contribute to the project.</li>
            <li><a href="namespaces/default.html">Explore the documentation API</a>: to see the available functions and classes.</li>
